                                                "sense_id": "e27fb9e9-3b71-3360-ac2a-75b78d46526f",
                                                "text": "Put it like this and it is not hard to see the possibility of a “post-capitalist” era – although the inability to see a path to it is what blights all modern social movements."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c4c6351-fb20-4696-a75b-acf91cf923f0",
                                                "sense_id": "e27fb9e9-3b71-3360-ac2a-75b78d46526f",
                                                "text": "As the world confronts more evidence of the effects of climate change – from floods in Pakistan to heatwaves in Britain – rampant inflation and the energy crisis, [Kohei] Saito’s vision of a more sustainable, post-capitalist world will appear in an academic text to be published next year by Cambridge University Press, with an English translation of his bestseller to follow."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
